# Line endings are stored and checked out exactly as committed; git never converts them.
#
# The tree is deliberately mixed -- static/index.html, README.md and some of legacy/ are CRLF,
# js/, scripts/ and most of tests/ are LF -- and a git with
# core.autocrlf=true (the Windows default) would otherwise rewrite files on checkout or stage
# and show every line as changed. `-text` switches that off for everyone, whatever their config.
* -text

# Binary assets: no diffs, no conversion.
*.mp3 binary
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.parquet binary
*.whl binary
*.zip binary
